    "text": "4 x 6.60 holes = 1/4 in all-thread clearance (6.35 + 0.25) on a 110.00 bolt circle (4.331 in) at 45/135/225/315 deg; 2 x 7.00 holes for a 1/4-20 U-bolt on 44.45 (1.750 in) centres along y; every through hole is INSIDE the seal, so put bonded sealing washers under the rod nuts and the U-bolt nuts or gas bypasses the O-ring"
